            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A neck? (ਗਰਦਨ, gardan.) A chest? (ਛਾਤੀ, chātī.) A back? (ਪਿੱਠ, piṭṭh.) A waist? (ਲੱਕ, lakk.) An elbow? (ਕੂਹਣੀ, kūhṇī.) A palm? (ਤਲੀ, talī.) A fingernail? (ਨਹੁੰ, nahũ.) A brain? (ਦਿਮਾਗ਼, dimāg.) A heel? (ਅੱਡੀ, aḍḍī.) An ankle? (ਗਿੱਟਾ, giṭṭā.) A ship? (ਜਹਾਜ਼, jahāz.) A traveller? (ਮੁਸਾਫ਼ਰ, musāfar.) An office? (ਦਫ਼ਤਰ, daftar.) A factory? (ਕਾਰਖ਼ਾਨਾ, kārkhānā.) A library? (ਲਾਇਬ੍ਰੇਰੀ, lāibrerī.) A town square? (ਚੌਂਕ, cauṅk.) A garden? (ਬਾਗ਼, bāg.) A pencil? (ਪੈਨਸਿਲ, painsil.) A class? (ਜਮਾਤ, jamāt.) A teacher? (ਅਧਿਆਪਕ, adhiāpak.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
